{"seq":3,"slug":"circuit-breaker-timeout-bulkhead","title":"熔断、超时预算与隔离舱：级联故障的工程防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/grpc-http2-microservice-communication-internals/grpc-reliability-patterns/circuit-breaker-timeout-bulkhead","wordCount":2501,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"熔断-超时预算与隔离舱-级联故障的工程防护\">熔断、超时预算与隔离舱：级联故障的工程防护</h1><p>跨境履约链路最典型的崩溃不是某个服务「挂了」，而是它「变慢了」。支付网关 p99 从 80ms 涨到 2s，上游订单服务的线程池被占满，清算、报关、物流查询一起排队——一次单点抖动几分钟内膨胀成全站不可用。gRPC 只提供<strong>取消与 deadline 传播</strong>这一条原语，剩下三道防线——熔断、超时预算、隔离舱——必须显式设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三个正交的失效域\">核心概念：三个正交的失效域</h2><p><strong>超时预算</strong>解决「等多久」，是时间维度的约束：一次调用允许占用多少墙钟时间，以及额度如何沿调用树下传。<strong>熔断</strong>解决「还要不要试」，是健康维度的判决：某上游的错误率或连续失败数越阈时暂时把它从可选集合摘除，让失败快速返回而非拖死调用方。<strong>隔离舱</strong>解决「一个坏依赖能吃掉多少资源」，是资源维度的配额：给每个下游分配独立连接池与并发额度，使 A 的拥堵无法挤占 B 的容量。</p>\n<p>判断标准：超时是<strong>单次调用</strong>的属性，熔断是<strong>上游整体</strong>的属性（跨调用累积统计），隔离舱是<strong>资源池</strong>的属性。组合顺序是——隔离舱先保证资源不被单一依赖垄断，熔断在隔离舱内部按上游判决健康，超时预算给每一次已放行的调用兜底。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;发起下游调用&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;隔离舱:检查并发/连接配额&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;配额已满&quot;| C[&quot;立即失败 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;配额可用&quot;| D[&quot;熔断器:读取上游健康状态&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;OPEN 驱逐窗口中&quot;| E[&quot;不发出,快速失败&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;CLOSED / HALF_OPEN&quot;| F[&quot;注入剩余 deadline 并发出&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G{&quot;响应状态&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;成功&quot;| H[&quot;归还配额,记录成功样本&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;映射为 5xx&quot;| I[&quot;归还配额,累加连续失败&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J{&quot;连续失败 ≥ 5 或错误率越阈&quot;}&#10;    J --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| H&#10;    J --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| K[&quot;驱逐该主机,退避按次数增长&quot;]&#10;    K --&gt; L{&quot;被驱逐占比触及恐慌阈值 50%?&quot;}&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| M[&quot;忽略健康状态,放行全部主机&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"发起下游调用\"] --&gt; B[\"隔离舱:检查并发/连接配额\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"配额已满\"| C[\"立即失败 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"配额可用\"| D[\"熔断器:读取上游健康状态\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"OPEN 驱逐窗口中\"| E[\"不发出,快速失败\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"CLOSED / HALF_OPEN\"| F[\"注入剩余 deadline 并发出\"]\n    F --&gt; G{\"响应状态\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"成功\"| H[\"归还配额,记录成功样本\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"映射为 5xx\"| I[\"归还配额,累加连续失败\"]\n    I --&gt; J{\"连续失败 ≥ 5 或错误率越阈\"}\n    J --&gt;|\"否\"| H\n    J --&gt;|\"是\"| K[\"驱逐该主机,退避按次数增长\"]\n    K --&gt; L{\"被驱逐占比触及恐慌阈值 50%?\"}\n    L --&gt;|\"是\"| M[\"忽略健康状态,放行全部主机\"]\n    L --&gt;|\"否\"| E</pre><p>图中「映射为 5xx」这一步是 gRPC 特有的坑：Envoy 的异常点检测（outlier detection）对 gRPC 请求<strong>使用 <code>grpc-status</code> 响应头映射出的 HTTP 状态</strong>，映射后 <code>5xx</code> 才算错误（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/outlier\">Envoy outlier detection 文档</a>）。即并非任何非 OK 的 gRPC 状态码都会被计为失败。哪些码值得重试，见 <a href=\"retry-hedging-backoff-budget\">重试、对冲与退避</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时预算-把-deadline-当作分布式契约\">超时预算：把 deadline 当作分布式契约</h2><p>gRPC 的 deadline 是<strong>绝对时间点</strong>，timeout 是「允许持续多久」，两者相加才是 deadline。关键事实：<strong>gRPC 没有默认 deadline</strong>，不显式设置就允许无限等待（<a href=\"https://grpc.io/docs/guides/deadlines/\">grpc.io/docs/guides/deadlines</a>）。</p>\n<p>deadline 沿调用树传播，传的是<strong>减去已耗时后的剩余 timeout</strong>：官方文档说明 gRPC 会将 deadline 转换成「已扣除流逝时间的 timeout」，以减轻时钟偏移。若调用方在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{now}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 收到 deadline 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{parent}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的请求，下一跳携带的剩余额度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{child} = \\alpha \\cdot \\bigl(T_{parent} - t_{now} - t_{overhead}\\bigr),\\qquad 0 &lt; \\alpha &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{overhead}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是本地序列化、排队与建连的预留，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是留给下游的余量系数。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，上游 deadline 到期的瞬间下游也被要求取消，下游返回的 <code>DEADLINE_EXCEEDED</code> 与上游自己的判定竞争，你会得到一堆无法归因的错误。</p>\n<p>AWS Builders&#39; Library 的取值方法：先定可接受的<strong>误超时率</strong>（如 0.1%），再设到对应的延迟分位数（该例中为 p99.9），并对 p99.9 与 p50 接近的服务追加 padding；过低则相反——该文警告这会导致「所有请求开始重试，小型后端延迟直接升级为完全中断」。timeout 还必须覆盖 <strong>DNS 解析、TLS 握手、新建 HTTP/2 连接</strong>：案例中 ~20ms 的 timeout 在部署后首批请求上失效，正是因为它包含了新建安全连接的开销；跨境 TLS 握手比机房内贵一个数量级（<a href=\"https://builder.aws.com/content/3EumjoZascWd1oZiEgL8ORlv3qE/timeouts-retries-and-backoff-with-jitter\">AWS Builders&#39; Library</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断-从统计窗口到驱逐\">熔断：从统计窗口到驱逐</h2><p>数据面熔断由 outlier detection 实现，它针对<strong>上游集群中的单台主机</strong>做统计与驱逐，而非整个集群开关。Envoy 文档给出的默认值构成可直接引用的基线（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/outlier_detection.proto\">outlier_detection.proto</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>consecutive_5xx</code></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>连续多少个映射为 5xx 的响应触发驱逐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>interval</code></td>\n<td>10000 ms</td>\n<td>统计与驱逐扫描周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>base_ejection_time</code></td>\n<td>30000 ms</td>\n<td>首次驱逐的基础时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_ejection_time</code></td>\n<td>300000 ms</td>\n<td>驱逐时长上限（除非 base 更大）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_ejection_percent</code></td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>单集群被驱逐主机占比上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enforcing_consecutive_5xx</code></td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>检测器实际执行驱逐的概率百分比</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>驱逐时长随<strong>连续被驱逐的次数</strong>线性增长：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>base_ejection_time</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> max_ejection_time</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{eject}(n) = \\min(\\text{base\\_ejection\\_time} \\times n,\\ \\text{max\\_ejection\\_time})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base_ejection_time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_ejection_time</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。一次偶发失败的驱逐只有 30s，被反复驱逐的主机退避会一路涨到 300s，避免熔断器对「已确认有问题」的主机反复做无谓探测。</p>\n<p><strong>恐慌阈值是熔断最重要的反向约束。</strong> Envoy 默认恐慌阈值为 <strong>50%</strong>：可用主机比例低于此值时忽略健康状态，把流量发给所有主机（或全部不发）（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/intro/arch_overview/upstream/load_balancing/panic_threshold\">panic threshold 文档</a>）。它与 10% 的 <code>max_ejection_percent</code> 共同防止熔断器的经典失败模式——<strong>过度驱逐导致级联</strong>：集群只有 3 台主机时，驱逐 2 台就只剩 1 台承担全部流量，那台也会被压垮。</p>\n<p><code>split_external_local_origin_errors</code> 是 gRPC 场景的关键开关。默认关闭时本地失败（超时、连接重置）与上游事务性错误合并统计；开启后连续 5xx 只统计外部错误，本地失败走独立计数器。<strong>跨境链路建议开启</strong>：跨境连接重置率天然高于机房内，若计入 5xx，健康主机会因网络抖动被误驱逐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隔离舱-连接池与并发限额\">隔离舱：连接池与并发限额</h2><p>隔离舱的核心是<strong>给每个下游一份独立的资源配额</strong>，使资源耗尽被限制在单一分区内。Azure 架构中心 Bulkhead 模式：调用多个服务的消费者可为每个服务分配一个连接池，某服务失败时只影响它自己的连接池，且成熟做法应把隔离舱与重试、熔断、限流组合使用（<a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/patterns/bulkhead\">Microsoft Learn: Bulkhead pattern</a>）。</p>\n<p>Envoy 的熔断器（circuit breakers）就是数据面上的隔离舱实现，其 proto 默认阈值（<a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto\">circuit_breaker.proto</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>溢出计数器</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>max_connections</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td><code>upstream_cx_overflow</code></td>\n<td>集群内连接数上限（含 draining）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_pending_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td><code>upstream_rq_pending_overflow</code></td>\n<td>等待就绪连接的排队请求上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_requests</code></td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td><code>upstream_rq_active_overflow</code></td>\n<td>同时在途请求上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_retries</code></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><code>upstream_rq_retry_overflow</code></td>\n<td>集群级同时在途重试上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三点必须记住。第一，<strong>阈值按上游集群且按优先级（priority）分别计数</strong>，由所有工作线程共享；共享是最终一致的，故线程竞争会让实际值略微越界。第二，<code>max_requests</code> 是 HTTP 语义的，<code>max_pending_requests</code> 对非 HTTP 流量退化为连接数上限。第三，HTTP 溢出时路由器注入 <code>x-envoy-overloaded</code> 响应头，这是隔离舱生效的可观测信号。</p>\n<p>HTTP/2 的多路复用使 <code>max_requests</code> 与 <code>max_pending_requests</code> 高度耦合：二者都未设置时，所有请求会多路复用到<strong>同一条连接</strong>上。这正是 gRPC 场景下必须显式设置 <code>max_requests</code> 的原因——它是唯一能在 HTTP/2 单连接上施加并发隔离的旋钮。多路复用与流控见 <a href=\"../http2-transport-multiplexing/hpack-priority-flow-control\">HPACK、优先级与流控</a>。</p>\n<p><code>max_retries</code> 默认值 3 看似宽松，Envoy 文档却建议<strong>配得更激进</strong>以阻止重试驱动的级联：每层重试 4 次、三层嵌套时最底层承受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^3 = 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 倍尝试量；AWS 的算例更极端，五层调用栈每层 3 次重试放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>243</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^5 = 243</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">243</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（<a href=\"https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/\">SRE Book: Addressing Cascading Failures</a>、AWS Builders&#39; Library 同前）。<strong>因此重试只能发生在一个层级</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三者协同-一条订单链路的参数落地\">三者协同：一条订单链路的参数落地</h2><p>假设订单服务对客户端的 SLO 是 800ms，同步调用支付（300ms，资金操作不可重试）、报关（400ms，查询延迟方差最大）、库存（150ms，幂等只读可重试）三个下游。三者之和 850ms 已超过上游 800ms，说明<strong>不可能三者同时用满</strong>——预算本就该压到链路实际并发分布之下，剩余余量由传播公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 吸收。对应地，隔离舱给三个下游的 <code>max_requests</code> 分别取 200 / 100 / 500，熔断上支付用 <code>consecutive_5xx: 5</code> 加错误来源分离、报关用成功率检测、库存只用连续失败——<strong>判决的严格程度应与该下游的失败代价成正比</strong>，不可重试的支付链路应当最早被摘除。</p>\n<p>队列长度是另一个易错参数。SRE 章节：稳态流量下队列应保持在线程池大小的 <strong>50% 或更少</strong>，或干脆无队列；该章算例显示队列为线程数 10 倍、单请求 100ms 时队尾请求要等 <strong>1.1 秒</strong>，在 800ms 的 SLO 下等于必死。对 gRPC 而言队列就是 <code>max_pending_requests</code>——它越大，请求在队列里耗尽 deadline 的概率越高。</p>\n<p>必须避免的反模式是<strong>过载时扩大容量</strong>。SRE 章节解释：死亡螺旋中的服务，新任务会立刻被压垮；即使活下来也带着冷缓存，此时 100% 请求都是昂贵路径，重启反而放大故障。正确做法是配合隔离舱做<strong>负载丢弃</strong>：超过在途阈值时直接返回 503，保住有用吞吐。gRPC 侧对应失败码 <code>RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED</code>，客户端应视为<strong>不可重试</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>三道防线各自回答一个正交问题：超时预算答「允许等多久」，熔断答「还要不要继续试」，隔离舱答「一个坏依赖最多能吃多少资源」。串成一句话就是那张图的顺序——先配额、再判决、后兜底。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>超时预算</strong>：gRPC 无默认 deadline，必须显式设置；传播的是扣除已耗时的<strong>剩余值</strong>；取值从可接受的误超时率倒推延迟分位数（0.1% → p99.9），并覆盖 DNS/TLS/建连全部开销。</li>\n<li><strong>熔断</strong>：默认 <code>consecutive_5xx: 5</code>、<code>interval: 10s</code>、<code>base_ejection_time: 30s</code>、<code>max_ejection_percent: 10%</code>，恐慌阈值 50%；gRPC 按 <code>grpc-status</code> 映射后的 HTTP 状态计错，跨境链路应开启 <code>split_external_local_origin_errors</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>隔离舱</strong>：circuit breakers 默认 <code>max_connections</code>/<code>max_pending_requests</code>/<code>max_requests</code> 均 1024、<code>max_retries</code> 为 3；HTTP/2 下 <code>max_requests</code> 是唯一能在单连接上施加并发隔离的旋钮，<code>x-envoy-overloaded</code> 是生效信号。</li>\n<li><strong>协同</strong>：重试只应发生在单一层级（三层 4 次重试 = 64 倍放大），队列保持在线程池的 50% 以内，过载时做负载丢弃而非扩容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文讨论<strong>已建立调用</strong>的防护。连接层的失败（GOAWAY、流被拒绝）属于传输层语义，见 <a href=\"../http2-transport-multiplexing/connection-goaway-keepalive-ops\">连接层 GOAWAY、keepalive 与运维</a>；实例如何被发现与选择决定熔断驱逐后流量落到哪里，见 <a href=\"load-balancing-name-resolution\">负载均衡与名称解析</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"熔断、超时预算与隔离舱：级联故障的工程防护","id":"熔断-超时预算与隔离舱-级联故障的工程防护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个正交的失效域","id":"核心概念-三个正交的失效域"},{"level":2,"text":"超时预算：把 deadline 当作分布式契约","id":"超时预算-把-deadline-当作分布式契约"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断：从统计窗口到驱逐","id":"熔断-从统计窗口到驱逐"},{"level":2,"text":"隔离舱：连接池与并发限额","id":"隔离舱-连接池与并发限额"},{"level":2,"text":"三者协同：一条订单链路的参数落地","id":"三者协同-一条订单链路的参数落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"名称解析与客户端负载均衡：gRPC 服务发现的连接管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/grpc-http2-microservice-communication-internals/grpc-reliability-patterns/load-balancing-name-resolution"},"next":{"title":"服务网格数据面：Sidecar 与 Proxyless 的 xDS 配置下发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/grpc-http2-microservice-communication-internals/mesh-observability-ops/sidecar-proxyless-xds-dataplane"}}